[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To bring up the display, GPU and video decoder at boot, and program an HDMI
mode so that HDMI audio works:

  sysrc vf2_display_enable=YES
  service vf2_display start

Loader tunables were installed as a sample; to use them:

  cp /boot/loader.conf.d/visionfive2.conf.sample \
     /boot/loader.conf.d/visionfive2.conf

What the service loads can be adjusted without editing it:

  vf2_display_modules="dmabuf ttm drm verisilicon pvrsrvkm wave5"
  vf2_display_setmode="YES"     # NO to load modules but set no mode
EOM
}
]
